@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@contentType = application/json

### Start or Get DM Conversation
# Replace :receiverId with actual user ID
POST http://localhost:5000/api/dm/64f1c2e3a1b2c3d4e5f60002
Content-Type: application/json

### Get All My DM Conversations
GET http://localhost:5000/api/dms
Content-Type: application/json

### Get Messages of a DM Conversation (Page 1)
# Replace :conversationId with actual conversation ID
GET http://localhost:5000/api/dm/64f1c2e3a1b2c3d4e5f60030/messages
Content-Type: application/json

### Get Messages of a DM Conversation (Page 2)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/dm/64f1c2e3a1b2c3d4e5f60030/messages?page=2&limit=30
Content-Type: application/json
### Send DM Message
POST {{baseUrl}}/dm/64f1c2e3a1b2c3d4e5f60030/message
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "content": "Hey! How are you?",
  "fileUrl": "",
  "fileName": ""
}

### Send DM Message with File
POST http://localhost:5000/api/dm/64f1c2e3a1b2c3d4e5f60030/message
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "content": "Here is the file you asked for",
  "fileUrl": "/uploads/1700000000000-report.pdf",
  "fileName": "report.pdf"
}